{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26884","headline":"过张邯郸庄 · 姚合","name":"过张邯郸庄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客行长似病，烦热束四肢。\n到君读书堂，忽若逢良医。\n堂前水交流，堂下树交枝。\n两门延风凉，洗我昏浊肌。\n与子还往熟，坐卧恣所宜。\n时时相献酬，文字当酒巵。\n野饭具藜藿，永日亦不饥。\n苟飡非其所，鱠炙爲蒺藜。\n时清士人闲，耕作唯文词。\n岂独乡里荐，当取四海知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26884.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26884","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}